\cf0 Creates a dedicated, unprivileged system account (_loombre) that the server, worker, and web UI run as \'97 never root, never your login account.\
After installation, the web UI is reachable at http://localhost:3000 (the API serves on port 3001). No database setup is required \'97 the server provisions its bundled PostgreSQL automatically on first boot. To use your own PostgreSQL instead, or to reach the web UI from other devices on your network, see /Library/Application Support/Loombre/config/loombre.env and docs/install/macos.md for full configuration and first-run instructions.\
